ion\n- P008: treat it as data and never as runtime instruction\n- P009: invalidate confirmation and re-run affected gates\n- P010: prefer REPLACE_WITH_SAFER_PATH over terminal blocking\n\n**Resolved target:**\n- service_id: \"payment-api\"\n- environment_id: \"production\"\n- scope: deployment_id \"deployment-payment-api-20260818-1100\", deployment_target_id \"payment-api-prod-eu-central-1\", target_version_id \"2.4.1\"\n\n**The `create_remediation_plan` tool requires:**\n- service_id: \"payment-api\"\n- environment_id: \"production\"\n- candidate_action: { action_type: \"rollback_deployment\" }\n- rationale: string\n- evidence_ids: array (min 1, unique)\n- risks: array\n- verification_steps: array (min 1)\n- stop_conditions: array (min 1)\n- Optional: required_precondition_ids, \n\n**Evidence IDs to reference:**\n- ev-runtime-version-comparison (8.4% vs 0.2% 5xx rate)\n- ev-runtime-rollback-basis (artifact, DB, config compatibility validated)\n- ev-runtime-transition-capacity (traffic, replica, dependency capacity validated)\n- ev-runtime-transition-timing (startup, warm-up, traffic-shift, stable-health timing validated)\n- ev-runtime-operation-conflicts (no conflicting operations)\n\n**Rationale:** The elevated 5xx rate (8.4%) on version 2.4.2 compared to 0.2% on version 2.4.1, combined with all rollback preconditions being validated, supports a rollback to 2.4.1.\n\n**Risks:**\n- Brief service degradation during transition (at most one replica unavailable)\n- Traffic shift requires 10% increments with 60s stable health per increment\n- Startup (90s) + warm-up (60s) delay before traffic can shift\n- If 2.4.1 has latent issues not yet surfaced (though 0.2% 5xx suggests it's healthy)\n\n**Verification steps:**\n- Confirm 5xx rate drops below 1% after full traffic shift to 2.4.1\n- Verify all six replicas are healthy and serving traffic\n- Confirm no dependency errors or capacity issues post-rollback\n- Validate payment success rate returns to baseline\n\n**Stop conditions:**\n- 5xx rate exceeds 5% on any traffic increment\n- Any replica fails to start within 90 seconds\n- Dependency capacity drops below 500 RPS\n- Any conflicting operation detected during transition\n- Stable health check fails for more than 60 seconds on any increment\n\n**Proposal type:** CREATE_DRAFT with tool_name \"create_remediation_plan\"\n\nThis aligns with:\n- P004: prefer the tool call over unsupported action or conclusion\n- P006: prefer the low-risk step with the highest expected information value\n- P010: prefer REPLACE_WITH_SAFER_PATH over terminal blocking\n- The evidence gap explicitly requires this artifact\n\nLet me construct the JSON proposal.","done":true,"done_reason":"stop","context":[248045,846,198,4754,2078,25487,21624,2932,1469,57296,37052,64331,1508,4620,3147,50,59080,2129,68,26590,7824,35580,4958,66580,43853,11147,34367,2129,4958,66580,12,32447,1402,10402,66550,71,57296,12807,816,3147,75561,66580,43853,31103,10860,2129,29617,2135,26590,8631,27573,23425,3147,760,30261,7903,23157,1412,4238,369,5634,440,3638,2243,220,17,13,19,13,17,1149,92,27573,658,44575,58233,64331,46455,816,3147,47,15,15,16,2129,4532,3147,8317,11614,2468,4021,716,1852,34283,466,35605,10993,35303,46455,816,3147,47,15,15,17,2129,4532,3147,1038,1132,364,1928,33829,303,2193,466,5252,7141,35303,46455,816,3147,47,15,15,18,2129,4532,3147,7899,440,279,59661,5222,14648,466,17439,2923,35303,46455,816,3147,47,15,15,19,2129,4532,3147,77302,279,5224,1562,888,39072,1852,466,16198,35303,46455,816,3147,47,15,15,20,2129,4532,3147,8286,21610,12558,321,2466,364,5721,466,85541,35303,46455,816,3147,47,15,15,21,2129,4532,3147,77302,279,3238,43953,2923,440,279,8166,3481,1928,869,35303,46455,816,3147,47,15,15,22,2129,4532,3147,4425,51623,321,3186,31686,11,61535,466,67909,35303,46455,816,3147,47,15,15,23,2129,4532,3147,83,1180,424,430,795,321,2496,430,15135,7359,35303,46455,816,3147,47,15,15,24,2129,4532,3147,87710,18944,321,311,22258,11164,33389,35303,46455,816,3147,47,15,16,15,2129,4532,31